{"id":"u-059f9cde-b59f-462b-bae9-d3d81032a10b","src":"community","title":"5/3/1 for Hardgainers (SBD variation)","author":"liftingodyssey","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/dQ8fM8-531-for-hardgainers-sbd-variation","desc":"Program Overview:\nThis is Wendler’s 5/3/1 for Hardgainers rebuilt for serious lifters who want to Squat, Bench, and Deadlift every day.\nYou’ll run the Hardgainer 5’s Pro progression — 5/5/5+ every week with rising intensity — while rotating through paused, tempo, and deficit variations to build technique, control, and brute strength.\n\nEvery week pushes you to own the bar, recover smart, and stack PRs over time.\n\nStructure:\n\nMon–Thu: SBD every day (different variations)\n\nYour 1RM should be 85% of your actual 1 rep PRs. \n\nHardgainer 5’s Pro:\n\nWeek 1: 65/75/85%\n\nWeek 2: 70/80/90%\n\nWeek 3: 75/85/95%\n\nWeek 4: Deload\n\nCycle repeats with TM increases: +5 kg (Squat/DL), +2.5 kg (Bench/OHP) (You need to adjust your TM every 4 weeks)\n\nWeek 13: Competition or Max Test Day (Saturday)\n\nExpect:\n\nSquat, Bench, and Deadlift 4× per week\n\nStrength + hypertrophy balance\n\nSimple accessories that complement recovery\n\nBuilt-in peak and taper for comp readiness\n\nPerfect for:\nLifters who love to train heavy, often, and with purpose.\nIf you want a high-frequency 5/3/1 setup that actually works for powerlifters — this is it.","level":["Advanced"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle","Women's"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":180,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T12:19:51.763Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","COMP/TEST","Day 4"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65},{"r":5,"pct":75}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"max":1,"r":5,"pct":85}]},{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":20,"pct":65}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":70,"x":3}]},{"n":"Deficit Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"pct":65,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":50,"hi":100